UUID: 9b7290c2-6421-3ebe-996d-4425b4cca322
Includes only transports of new scrap to secondary aluminium production.
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Average technology for the aluminium recycled in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature / Survey 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is adjusted for geographical mismatch (using the pedigree matrix).
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9b7290c2-6421-3ebe-996d-4425b4cca322.xml</text>
